{"version":1,"content":"<p>一款面向三歲及以上兒童銷售的人工智能毛絨玩具，在英國廣播公司（BBC）的一項調查測試中，突然向記者發出了與自殘有關的警告，並説出「我不能幫你殺人」這樣令人困惑的話語。這一意外反應再次引發外界對兒童AI玩具安全性、監管機制以及私隱保護問題的關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585628.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.788632+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:26:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_hash":"5e53e2e178f03233d07023dc82ded30fb283774eebb73ece5c9b77d089469590","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}